	)
	(text_box "Two LMR51625 as the bay node's (TI SLUSF64B table 8-1: 4.7 µH FXL0630, 2 × 10 µF + 100 nF in, 3 × 22 µF out).\n+5V_A: ports 1–3 and the logic (hub, co-processor, matrix, 3.3 V LDO); +5V_B: ports 4–6.  Never in parallel:\n  the power plane's +5V split left / right.  Load: 6 × 0.5 A + 0.25 A logic = 3.25 A; 4 A at the TPS2553s'\n  0.62 A limit (A ≤ 2.1 A, B ≤ 1.9 A).\nFB 100k/18k: 5.24 V, as the node's.  EN 100k/10k: on above 13.5 V, off below 10.8 V.\nVIN from the node's VRACK after its reverse-protection P-FET (node rev. B): no second protection here.\n  ≈ 0.95 A at 20 V, 0.7 A at 28 V; a PH contact carries 2 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 142.24 0)
		(size 508 20.32)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
